WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:02.401
- I get what I want and if you are a no,

00:00:02.401 --> 00:00:06.234
I'm just gonna climb
over you and find my yes.

00:00:10.980 --> 00:00:13.035
- The best advice that
I would have to pass

00:00:13.035 --> 00:00:15.346
to the next generation of women,

00:00:15.346 --> 00:00:16.832
and as I'm still learning it myself,

00:00:16.832 --> 00:00:19.967
is to trust your gut and your light

00:00:19.967 --> 00:00:22.219
and don't dim your light for anybody.

00:00:22.219 --> 00:00:23.890
And no matter how many nos you get,

00:00:23.890 --> 00:00:26.735
you look in the mirror and
you tell yourself, yes I can.

00:00:26.735 --> 00:00:29.475
And you continue to push
forward no matter what.

00:00:29.475 --> 00:00:30.937
That's what I have to say.
- Absolutely.

00:00:30.937 --> 00:00:33.020
- Pay no attention to no.

00:00:34.653 --> 00:00:36.844
I pay no attention to no at all.

00:00:36.844 --> 00:00:39.479
In fact, if you let me tell
it, I've never heard no.

00:00:39.479 --> 00:00:40.640
I've never heard no.

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:43.531
- To not let anyone break your spirit.

00:00:43.531 --> 00:00:48.082
To try to remove the self
doubt as early as you can.

00:00:48.082 --> 00:00:52.249
To support other women, to
surround yourself with mentors,

00:00:53.411 --> 00:00:55.826
to seek out the smartest
people in the room

00:00:55.826 --> 00:00:58.183
to be your mentors.

00:00:58.183 --> 00:01:01.538
To listen, to learn, to stay hungry,

00:01:01.538 --> 00:01:03.849
and to take every opportunity you can.

00:01:03.849 --> 00:01:06.516
- To believe that you can do it.

00:01:08.118 --> 00:01:10.173
And not do it ever in an angry way.

00:01:10.173 --> 00:01:13.459
Don't be a woman trying to
be a man in a man's world.

00:01:13.459 --> 00:01:17.569
Like, be a sister, lift
your other fellow girls up.

00:01:17.569 --> 00:01:21.284
Be all about girl power and
just believe in yourself.

00:01:21.284 --> 00:01:24.268
Resist, resist, and
your voice does matter.

00:01:24.268 --> 00:01:25.684
- As someone once told me

00:01:25.684 --> 00:01:27.727
when I got my job on The Today Show,

00:01:27.727 --> 00:01:30.525
he said, today you could
be drinking the wine,

00:01:30.525 --> 00:01:33.196
tomorrow you could be picking the grapes.

00:01:33.196 --> 00:01:35.785
I think success comes and goes

00:01:35.785 --> 00:01:39.012
and you have high points and
low points in your career,

00:01:39.012 --> 00:01:41.497
and I think it's really
important how you treat people.

00:01:41.497 --> 00:01:43.877
Because the same people who help you up

00:01:43.877 --> 00:01:45.839
are going to catch you when you fall.

00:01:45.839 --> 00:01:47.859
Kindness and compassion
should go hand in hand

00:01:47.859 --> 00:01:49.299
with ambition and drive.

00:01:49.299 --> 00:01:51.017
- To trust yourself.

00:01:51.017 --> 00:01:53.684
To get grounded in your beliefs.

00:01:54.860 --> 00:01:57.797
And to not doubt yourself.

00:01:57.797 --> 00:01:59.783
- Believe in yourself to go forward

00:01:59.783 --> 00:02:03.858
and to try to bring your
belief system to the world.

00:02:03.858 --> 00:02:08.025
- I wish someone had said to
me, don't settle for less.

00:02:10.081 --> 00:02:12.449
Or if they said that to me, I
wish I would have believed it.

00:02:12.449 --> 00:02:13.949
Because it's true.

